ed.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Blood</b> may also refer to:\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Actions_and_features\">Actions and features</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Sacrifice\" title=\"Blood Sacrifice\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp/25px-Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp/38px-Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp/50px-Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blood Sacrifice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp/25px-Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Sacrifice\" title=\"Blood Sacrifice\">Blood Sacrifice</a>, a class action granted by <a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Dagger\" title=\"Ritual Dagger\">Ritual Dagger</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Money\" title=\"Blood Money\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Blood_Money_Icon.webp/25px-Blood_Money_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Blood_Money_Icon.webp/38px-Blood_Money_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Blood_Money_Icon.webp/50px-Blood_Money_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blood Money\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Blood_Money_Icon.webp/25px-Blood_Money_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Blood_Money_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Money\" title=\"Blood Money\">Blood Money</a>, a weapon action granted by <a h